					item: "productivebees:advanced_oak_beehive"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			title: "A Home for Bees"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1E64986BC9048338"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #3502: Comb]"
				""
				"The bee goes out, finds a flower, comes back and spends a while inside. When it leaves again,"
				"there's a &bhoneycomb&r in the hive. Right-click the advanced beehive: you can see who's home and take"
				"the combs out of its slots. A hopper underneath does it for you."
				"Nothing coming? Check the obvious: daylight, no rain, flowers close by, the hive's front not blocked."
				"&7In a hurry, you can whack the hive with a stick to throw a bee out. It loses its trip. So do you."
			]
			id: "665C6224699B504A"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 3
					id: "79D61F32BF605241"
					item: "positronics:ncp_scrip"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			tasks: [
				{
					count: 4L
					id: "5AE1A1D0BE4E7902"
					item: "minecraft:honeycomb"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			title: "First Comb"
			x: 2.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["665C6224699B504A"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #3503: Spin]"
				""
				"A comb is wax holding honey. The Productive Bees &bCentrifuge&r (seven iron ingots round a grindstone)"
				"spins them apart: every honeycomb gives &bwax&r and &b100 mB of honey&r, kept in its tank (10 buckets)."
				"It needs no power: &b15 seconds&r a comb. A hopper feeds it, or just drop combs on top."
				"&7Don't bother eating the combs. You'll see."
			]
			id: "1CB383807D8DDD83"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 3
					id: "695A01F711FED77F"
					item: "positronics:ncp_scrip"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "795391C43F6937E0"
					item: "productivebees:centrifuge"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			title: "The Centrifuge"
			x: 4.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1CB383807D8DDD83"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #3504: Bottler]"
				""
				"Honey in a tank is no use to you yet. Put a &bBottler&r (iron ingots, glass, a smooth stone slab)"
				"right next to the centrifuge and it fills itself. Give it glass bottles: &b250 mB&r a bottle,"
				"so two and a half combs make one &bhoney bottle&r."
			]
			id: "278E2B578F380076"
			rewards: [
				{
