			title: "Sugar Atoms"
			x: 10.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["647A9F38BEF74CD7"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #3508: Colony]"
				""
				"One bee is a hobby. An &bexpansion box&r (eight oak planks round a honeycomb) on top of the advanced"
				"beehive takes it from 3 bees to &b5&r, and opens the upgrade slots (productivity, speed)."
				"&aMore bees:&r feed two grown honey bees a flower each and they breed. Honey eggs are also in the NCP Shop."
				"&bBee cages&r (a honey bottle between two planks, four at a time) carry a bee: right-click it to catch,"
				"right-click the ground to let it go. Sneak to let it go on a hive and that hive becomes its home."
				"A &bhoney treat&r (comb and honey bottle) calms an angry bee and grows a baby faster."
				"&7Solitary bees from the Shop won't live in a hive. They want a nest: an Ashy Mining bee takes a coarse dirt"
				"&7nest (a wooden sword and coarse dirt). Pretty, but they make nothing you need yet."
			]
			id: "3AE416EDEA558437"
